            <div xml:id="d514-a11">

                <pb facs="0746" n="726" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg726"/>

                <head>Deposition of John Martin..</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States of America,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Southern District of New York, ss :</hi></p>
                <p>John Martin, of Ireland, being duly sworn, says that he was on board the sloop
                    Racer during the time mentioned in the annexed affidavits of Russell and<pb
                        facs="0747" n="727" xml:id="pg727"/>Birt, and that the same, so far as they
                    set out the voyage of the sloop Racer. and her capture and detention, and the
                    detention and imprisonment of the persons on board of her, are true to the
                    knowledge of this deponent.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">JOHN MARTIN.</p>
                <p>Sworn to before me this 24th day of September, 1864.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">[l. s.]</hi></p>
                <p>[Revenue Stamp.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANKLIN A. WILCOX, <hi rendition="#italic">Notary
                    Public.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
